{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely in JavaFX,\u00a0<strong>Nocturne FX\u2122</strong> starts simple, but the skies do not stay calm for long. Chaos builds with every action as brutal speed, unpredictable power-ups that can save you or sabotage you, and shifting rules demand constant adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure arcade action built for the modern era. Fast, punishing, and endlessly replayable, every run is a test of focus and reflexes. Learn the patterns, adapt on the fly, and chase that one perfect score that always feels just out of reach. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Flap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"First Time?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"Twice the Fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"New Kid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb81b662efdb1af7ca7b09b41.jpg"},{"name":"No Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3739280/efc171a6069b0dabb8